   "native_decoder": "Place layer types 0,1,2 in that order from z=-total_height/2, with full thickness W[type]. Within each layer, concatenate row types0,1 and center the total row height in y. Center every row in x. For row type r the orientation index is2*layer_type+r, cell widths follow its stored intrinsic permutation, and each center is cell midpoint minus its own rigorous box midpoint. Retain precisely the listed owner words; round centers once to binary64 and host scale upward.",
   "pair_rule": "Different layers separate in z; rows within one layer separate in y; cells within one row separate in x. Every relation concerns the complete owner.",
